Wrong (B): There is no general prohibition on deferred taxes in business combinations. Deferred taxes are routinely recognized on acquired assets and liabilities with book-tax differences.
Wrong (C): The indefinite reinvestment assertion relates to undistributed foreign earnings under ASC 740-30, not to goodwill recognition.
